# KarthiMart
KarthiMart is a simple Java-based shopping cart application.
## Features
- View 25 products
- Add products to cart
- View cart
- Calculate total amount
- Place order
- Clear cart after order
## Technologies
- Java
- OOP
- ArrayList
## How to Run
Compile:
javac Product.java Cart.java KarthiMart.java
Run:
java KarthiMart
